     1861         UNDO Main-Block,  return error var-mes.
     1862       end.
     1863       if varsum-gds-base-dtl <> buf_wth-line.sum-gds-base then do:
     1864         var-mes = "Документ МЦ" + chr(32) + buf_wth-doc.doc-code + chr(10) +
     1865                   "Код МЦ" +  chr(32) +  string(buf_wth-line.wth-code) + chr(10) +
